# Printer edits

You are in the formatting library.

## Do

- Add typed construct printers and shared `LayoutRules`
- Fail closed on syntax errors in new paths
- Preserve statement shape and top-level order unless an explicit option says otherwise
- Keep spacing policy in one place
- Update `docs/SUPPORTED.md` when construct status changes

## Do not

- Extend `AddSpacesAroundBinaryOperators` / similar regex helpers as the primary fix
- Add more ERROR-node glue in `FormatSourceFile` / fallbacks
- Add expression-wrapper recovery to new code paths
- Brace-wrap bare `if` bodies by default
- Reorder includes/functions by default
- Leave debug `Console.WriteLine` in the printer

If the change only works by formatting a broken parse tree, stop and classify the case before coding.
